Output assets/demo.gif
Source vhs/common.tape
Hide
Type `alias t-='command t- --theme tokyo-night --effect beams'; clear`
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

# Stays on tokyo-night (Omarchy's default theme) and steps through effects.
Type "t- --demo"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
# burn
Down@60ms 5
Sleep 4s
# blackhole
Down@60ms 6
Sleep 4.5s
# fireworks
Down@60ms 6
Sleep 4.5s
# sweep
Down@60ms 14
Sleep 3.5s
# thunderstorm
Down@60ms 2
Sleep 4.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 2s
